        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Karl Kraepelin\n- Animals: Scorpion, Boiga kraepelini\n- Works: \"Scorpiones und Pedipalpi\"\n- Concepts: Leg count, eponymy\n\nFacts:\n- Karl Kraepelin was a German naturalist.\n- Boiga kraepelini is named after Karl Kraepelin.\n- Karl Kraepelin discussed scorpions in \"Scorpiones und Pedipalpi.\"\n- A scorpion has eight legs.",
